<title>USA: Northwest Natural Gas president named CEO.</title>
<headline>Northwest Natural Gas president named CEO.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore. 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northwest Natural Gas Co said Monday that Richard Reiten, its president and chief operating officer, will become chief executive officer on January 1.</p>
<p>Reiten succeeds Robert Ridgley, who will retire but continue as chairman of the board, the company said.</p>
